{{!
    @template theme_brandable/editor_pricing

    Under the prices of the offers: the tax mention and the billing contact; when Brandable does not sell in the billing
    country of the organisation, the contact only (no payment).

    Context variables required for this template:
    * showprices - Whether prices are shown above
    * taxnote - Mention shown with every price
    * countrysupported - Whether online payment is available in the billing country
    * billingcontacturl - Billing contact page (may be empty)
    * countryrequired, countries - The billing country is asked before a purchase ([{code, name, selected}])
    * countrylocked, billingcountry - The billing country fixed at the first payment (shown, not asked)

    Example context (json):
    {
        "showprices": true,
        "taxnote": "Prix hors taxes. Taxes éventuelles en sus selon le pays.",
        "countrysupported": true,
        "billingcontacturl": "https://app.brandablelms.com/billing/contact",
        "countryrequired": true,
        "countries": [{"code": "FR", "name": "France", "selected": true}]
    }
}}
{{#countrysupported}}
    {{#showprices}}
        {{#countryrequired}}{{> theme_brandable/editor_billingcountry }}{{/countryrequired}}
        {{#countrylocked}}
            <div class="tbe-hint" data-region="billingcountrylocked">{{#str}} account:billingcountrylocked, theme_brandable, {{billingcountry}} {{/str}}</div>
        {{/countrylocked}}
        <div class="tbe-hint tbe-pricing" data-region="taxnote">{{taxnote}}</div>
        {{#billingcontacturl}}
            <a class="tbe-hint" href="{{billingcontacturl}}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{#str}} account:billingcontact, theme_brandable {{/str}}</a>
        {{/billingcontacturl}}
    {{/showprices}}
{{/countrysupported}}
{{^countrysupported}}
    <div class="tbe-hint" data-region="countrynotsupported">{{#str}} account:countrynotsupported, theme_brandable {{/str}}</div>
    {{#billingcontacturl}}
        <a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary" href="{{billingcontacturl}}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{#str}} account:contactbilling, theme_brandable {{/str}}</a>
    {{/billingcontacturl}}
{{/countrysupported}}
